<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Intuitive user workflows</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=AD Thi=
nk Out Loud: Teaching Moment</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Khi t=C3=B4i mentor junior engin=
eers, t=C3=B4i th=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Dng give them exercise: "Design Twitter feed=
 feature."</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Back End Focus Questions=
:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to store tweets efficiently=
?</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to handle millions of users=
?</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to generate personalized ti=
meline?</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to ensure data consistency?=
</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Front End Focus Question=
s:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to display tweets smoothly?=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to handle real-time updates=
?</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to implement infinite scrol=
l?</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">How to optimize for mobile devi=
ces?</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Insight</strong>: Same f=
eature, completely different design concerns. This is why front end system =
design interviews exist - to test different skillset.</p>
